{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b28330b5dbb167c69cd3619303f5bd680b0c2a6ba71296d503cdfb913cf4681c","ja":"わあっ……すごい！　ボクたちのために、\nこんなに集まってくれたんだ！？","zh":"哇……好厉害！为了我们，竟然聚集了这么多人！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"65f62890b2ed4f3905e3d578a8b4d470c25536e8b41b443bc4733d66861918a5","ja":"これだけたくさんいると、なんだか迫力がありますね。\nこの人数で、今から歌って踊る……ドキドキだぞ。","zh":"人这么多，总觉得气势十足呢。\n这么多人现在就要一起唱歌跳舞……真让人心跳加速啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8212bc1aec1d75cfed44b9aee806f0de6a6cf6cee7904d66582b19bd84588672","ja":"ボクもなんだか緊張してきたよ……あれっ？\nエレナと千鶴さん。慌ててどうしたんだろう……？","zh":"我也不知不觉紧张起来了……咦？\n艾蕾娜和千鹤小姐。她们慌慌张张的，这是怎么了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"dadec61cc05de460610b008b7a8494b3ca9df1cf1b37f2b68169d7f8f17a738b","ja":"大変だヨ～！　ハンドベル、\nもしかしたら間に合わないかもって！","zh":"不得了啦～！手摇铃，搞不好要来不及了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"41c1cde575a9ca2c7410150b1eb39f7283754bec749555fb69968cb2b7d90519","ja":"大渋滞で、到着を待っていると\n暗くなってしまうかもしれないとかで……。","zh":"听说因为严重堵车，等到抵达时可能天都要黑了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"986c4059a4bcdb8108d43edd4e9952883a3ee5135e182e5ccad9421866e6d484","ja":"ええ～っ！？\nど、どうしたらいいんだろう……！？","zh":"诶——！？\n该、该怎么办才好……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"02bfbb4636b1d5ee5f6305a4a182bb6e506177f459e2cade62a7337b69c2d8d2","ja":"踊りが苦手な人に、今から覚えてもらうわけにも\nいきませんし……ピンチだぞ。","zh":"也不能让不擅长跳舞的人现在开始学啊……\n这下糟了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_976.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"97ece06aa8d04f87997b10197b1c14d7357cb4bcdce4a011563cb896b1b9d0e4","ja":"でも、せっかく来てくれたんだから\nみんなで撮影したいよね……。","zh":"不过，难得大家都来了，\n还是想和大家一起拍照呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
